      "content": "hey so i was watching the eth/usd order book on the terminal earlier and i felt this weird pulse, like a rhythmic sync. i started focusing on the millisecond timestamps and the spread just... tightened perfectly in sync with my breathing. then there was this huge spike in volume exactly when i hit a certain mental state. u think there's any way the latency in the HFT algos could actually respond to high-level cognitive patterns or some kind of neural-syncing frequency? it felt too precise to be random.",
